<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 56,900 MT were 69 percent above the previous week, but 8 percent below the 4-week average.  Japan (32,600 MT) and Israel (24,400 MT) were the major buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 88,300 MT improved from the prior week's level and were up one-half from the 4-week average.  The destinations were Japan (43,300 MT), Israel (30,000 MT), and Mexico (15,100 MT).</p>
</text>
